# Fire Safety Systems Integration Tests - Implementation Plan

## Overview
Create comprehensive integration tests for the fire safety systems note evaluation framework. These tests will validate end-to-end behavior of the orchestrator with note evaluations in realistic multi-firecell building scenarios.

## Current State Analysis

### Existing Integration Tests
1. **project-model-integration.test.js**
   - Tests ProjectModel CRUD operations
   - 20 diverse firecells covering all risk groups
   - Does NOT test fire safety systems processing
   - Does NOT test note evaluations

2. **occupant-load-integration.test.js**
   - Tests occupant load processing with ProjectModel
   - Validates calculated occupant loads
   - 5 firecells, various risk groups

### Gap Analysis
**Missing Coverage:**
- ❌ No integration tests for `processFireSafetySystems()`
- ❌ No tests for note evaluation in real scenarios
- ❌ No cross-firecell dependency tests (notes 1b, 1c, 9, 10)
- ❌ No validation of `fireSafetySystemsCompliance` data storage
- ❌ No end-to-end tests showing system removal/addition
- ❌ No multi-risk building scenarios
- ❌ No tests verifying notes only apply when system codes reference them

